Play in "Cash Masters" game and choose whom you want to become! Philanthropist or playboy? Millionaire or Billionaire?

You can try to grow up the career ladder from rags and poverty to a top specialist or even a head of a company! Become an entrepreneur and open one or more businesses in a row. Invest wisely and make influential acquaintances with the cream of society.

Anyone can become rich and conquer the world! Prove to everyone that there is no one better and richer than you in the whole universe. Spend money as you like and enjoy life.

Develop personal relationships with beautiful women. Choose the best and make her a marriage proposal. Build a family, raise children, and then grandchildren. Feel family happiness!

Accumulate millions in your account, buy businesses, enjoy the decisions you make. And if something goes wrong at a certain moment, then use the time machine, go back in time and start all over again!

Features of "Cash Masters" game:
- Easy path to riches;
- Tons of earning options;
- A lot of luxury items;
- Many ways for development;
- Different ways to earn money;
- Colorful graphics and heroes;
- Fun and addictive gameplay;
- Amazing choices and plot;
- Billions of money in our game!

When all money in the world become yours, you will have to select between planet safe and your own pleasure...

If you decide to save the planet, you can build a spaceship and colonize a new planet! Build a reliable and technologically advanced ship, prepare the essentials for colonization, and set off on a space journey!

And if you choose entertainment, well—your decision. Let every million spent be a joy to you. Collect cars, meet the hottest girls and dive into the most pleasant moments of life with billions in your account. Forget about traffic jams with your personal yacht and business jet. Live in a luxurious mansion outside the city, in a villa on a private island, or in the most luxurious apartment in the center of the metropolis.

Everyone can become a rich person, you just have to want it. When you earned all money in the world, you can choose: spend it all on yourself or save the planet and all living beings? The choice is yours! Play in the game, earn all money in the world and become the best!

Introducing MultiCraft ― world of unlimited opportunities! Get ready for real Adventures!

Build and destroy Blocks, gather Resources, and create a variety of Tools, Items, and Weapons to Survive and create unique Buildings. Show off your skills in Building and Survival in this thrilling world where every step presents an opportunity for new discoveries and adventures. Join us and dive into the world of MultiCraft today!

In this world, the choice is yours — become a Builder in Creative mode or a Ruthless Hunter fighting for survival in Survival mode!

► Be careful, in this world not only peaceful Animals, but an awful Monsters too! Win a battle with them and you will get priceless resources!
► Swim across the seas for new lands and resources ― lands are unlimited. Exploration them!
► If you decided to Survive ― keep eye on hunger and fill out it in time! Search for food, grow plants and kill mobs for meat!
► Built your shelter from the monsters and you will survive this night! They are coming for you… Zombies, Skeletons, Huge Spiders and other hostile mobs.
► At any time you can fly to the skies with the «Fly» mode or become fast as flash with the «Fast» mode.
► Set your Home Point, create Waypoints, and adjust the Time of Day. Play by your own rules, because it's your own world!

Your actions are limited only by your imagination in this game! No specific skills required — you'll understand the basics within the first few minutes. With MultiCraft, you can have fun anywhere, anytime! And it’s totally FREE!

Do you want to play with your friends? Join one of the many custom servers («Multiplayer» tab) or create your own («Host Server» tab) for free. The game has a constantly updated list of various servers. You're sure to find one you like!

In our game, you can expect:
► Peaceful mobs like Cows, Pigs, and Sheep;
► Wolves and Dogs;
► Huge and Small Spiders;
► Insidious Skeletons with Bows;
► Powerful Zombies and other hostile mobs;
► Red and Blue ore, mechanisms and hoppers;
► A realistic gaming experience;
► Pandas, Penguins and Seals;
► Egg-carrying Chickens;
► Stable FPS and drawing world without lag;
► High game optimization and world generation for all modern devices;
► Various biomes and a unique world terrain;
► A wide variety of food and plant items;
► Crafting Guide with a list of all items and recipes;
► Reworked touch controls for easy gameplay;
► Singleplayer with Survival and Creative modes;
► Easy game mode switching in the Main Menu;
► Accelerated flight and walking;
► Multiplayer mode on numerous free servers;
► Free creation of your own server to play with your friends directly in the game menu.
